flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[/Read binary number b/]
    B --> C[decimal ← 0, place ← 1]
    C --> D{b ≠ 0?}
    D -->|Yes| E[d ← b mod 10]
    E --> F{d = 0 or d = 1?}
    F -->|No| G[/Print Invalid binary number/]
    G --> Z([Stop])
    F -->|Yes| H[decimal ← decimal + d × place]
    H --> I[place ← place × 2]
    I --> J[b ← b div 10]
    J --> D
    D -->|No| K[/Print decimal/]
    K --> Z
